Hanumān drags cloud banks across starry sky --- Hanumān touches Sunābha and roars toward Mahēndra --- Jāmbavān declares roar proves task done --- Monkeys leap waving branches to greet Hanumān --- Monkeys worship Hanumān with roots fruits and shouts --- Hanumān bows elders and says goddess seen --- Hanumān reports single-braided fasting Sītā under guard --- Monkeys exult waving tails and touching Hanumān --- Aṅgada praises leap and hopes grief ends --- Hosts sit round eager to hear Laṅkā tale
